8
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,860
Personally, I haven't been troubled by any of them yet.

9
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,180
But yeah, I have seen a lot of people who come after Coimbatore.

10
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:25,600
