11
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:30,800
They are scared of people and run after them.

12
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:36,100
It seems like they will be almost cut off but I have never seen anyone being cut off from dogs.

13
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:47,820
Many people have a opinion that they want to keep dogs, but here there are designated trading spots.

14
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,860
If we go in hostels...

15
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:51,480
