23
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,300
And secondly, not students but the community should feed them.

24
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:27,660
They should keep some food where there are designated spots.

25
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:34,700
They are never feeling so hungry that they have to attack people personally.

26
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:39,500
So like you said about organizations, there is already an organization on campus.

27
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:41,220
Did you know anything about it?

28
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:43,480
