Yes, when someone talked about some males then only through them would I know.

30
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:53,050
Your personal opinion or...

31
00:01:53,050 --> 00:01:54,870
What do you think?

32
00:01:55,830 --> 00:01:57,250
Should we keep all of us out from the hostel?

33
00:01:59,710 --> 00:02:00,510
I am very scared of dogs.

34
00:02:01,790 --> 00:02:02,990
Yes, I'm very scared of them.

35
00:02:03,390 --> 00:02:05,130
But yes they are also living beings

36
00:02:05,830 --> 00:02:08,530
They say that dogs are the best companions for human beings

37
00:02:08,530 --> 00:02:09,470
and they leave everyone

38
00:02:09,470 --> 00:02:11,790
and all of us live with them

39
00:02:12,450 --> 00:02:13,810
So we should take care

40
00:02:13,810 --> 00:02:15,870
as they take care of us throughout

41
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:16,570
the night

42
00:02:16,570 --> 00:02:18,930
There are many stories where

43
00:02:18,930 --> 00:02:21,310
dogs help people out

44
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:23,530
