46
00:02:25,770 --> 00:02:27,490
We should try

47
00:02:27,490 --> 00:02:30,770
We treat dogs as living beings and not as trash.

48
00:02:31,010 --> 00:02:33,370
They are not trash, they're not dead bodies.

49
00:02:33,790 --> 00:02:37,490
They are human living beings who actually need care from us.

